{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons are rising up slowly from the underworld and taking over the world. You are an\u00a0agent of the undercover demon hunt group, disguised as a church. As an agent your\u00a0mission is to breakthrough the dungeons occupied by demons and recover the world with\u00a0the power of light bit by bit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the light</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a huge limitation regarding visual range. Overall, you could see only the portions of the map, where the light is lit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as 2 type of agent,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword Type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7e959053a93ca94d9209cd0d226f141c.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7e959053a93ca94d9209cd0d226f141c.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7e959053a93ca94d9209cd0d226f141c.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/e2134a372f2403d8aab809c858974c11.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/e2134a372f2403d8aab809c858974c11.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/e2134a372f2403d8aab809c858974c11.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD / Arrow Key - Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space - Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left mouse - Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab - Change weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F - Pray / Interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunting Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/57d4827bdcfb6af9bc3ed5acad49b5df.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/57d4827bdcfb6af9bc3ed5acad49b5df.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/57d4827bdcfb6af9bc3ed5acad49b5df.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are swarms of demons everywhere that's blocking your way. As you hunt them down, you will gain experience and get stronger, along with an opportunity to get a stat upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These demons will drop items such as a heart, or a fire looking soul for you to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lighting Candles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/ef28101675397e597284acdbc08a6ed2.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/ef28101675397e597284acdbc08a6ed2.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/ef28101675397e597284acdbc08a6ed2.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are candles scattered around the area. The fires coming out from the demons are needed to light the candles. Light all of them to progress to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/4d9af28d0c4bcb0a6fed2ce9d9e59aab.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/4d9af28d0c4bcb0a6fed2ce9d9e59aab.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/4d9af28d0c4bcb0a6fed2ce9d9e59aab.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of how the cursor reacts to the candles. the more closer it is to the candle, the more faster it starts to react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Praying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7cd73c1a378e31727832ccd9d3535546.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7cd73c1a378e31727832ccd9d3535546.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7cd73c1a378e31727832ccd9d3535546.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Praying is initiated when holding the F key. hold long enough to heal the MP yourself. Praying is also used for lighting candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden events could randomly happen while exploring the dungeon. It's up to you to check it out.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Salvation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3737700/bfa7c973011aa8f88c7e87d8bcd05e989d3c61dd.jpg"},{"name":"Berserk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3737700/31558d7493fd948d7af916be7c335002f4bb451b.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737700?t=1754414826","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737700?t=1754414826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/dfdcc85194c0d562c310b8f5a9a74ecea046b4f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754414826","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/dfdcc85194c0d562c310b8f5a9a74ecea046b4f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754414826","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: \r\n**Blood Warning, Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons are rising up slowly from the underworld and taking over the world. You are an\u00a0agent of the undercover demon hunt group, disguised as a church. As an agent your\u00a0mission is to breakthrough the dungeons occupied by demons and recover the world with\u00a0the power of light bit by bit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the light</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a huge limitation regarding visual range. Overall, you could see only the portions of the map, where the light is lit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as 2 type of agent,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword Type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7e959053a93ca94d9209cd0d226f141c.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7e959053a93ca94d9209cd0d226f141c.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7e959053a93ca94d9209cd0d226f141c.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/e2134a372f2403d8aab809c858974c11.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/e2134a372f2403d8aab809c858974c11.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/e2134a372f2403d8aab809c858974c11.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD / Arrow Key - Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space - Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left mouse - Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab - Change weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F - Pray / Interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunting Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/57d4827bdcfb6af9bc3ed5acad49b5df.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/57d4827bdcfb6af9bc3ed5acad49b5df.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/57d4827bdcfb6af9bc3ed5acad49b5df.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are swarms of demons everywhere that's blocking your way. As you hunt them down, you will gain experience and get stronger, along with an opportunity to get a stat upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These demons will drop items such as a heart, or a fire looking soul for you to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lighting Candles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/ef28101675397e597284acdbc08a6ed2.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/ef28101675397e597284acdbc08a6ed2.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/ef28101675397e597284acdbc08a6ed2.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are candles scattered around the area. The fires coming out from the demons are needed to light the candles. Light all of them to progress to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/4d9af28d0c4bcb0a6fed2ce9d9e59aab.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/4d9af28d0c4bcb0a6fed2ce9d9e59aab.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/4d9af28d0c4bcb0a6fed2ce9d9e59aab.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of how the cursor reacts to the candles. the more closer it is to the candle, the more faster it starts to react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Praying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7cd73c1a378e31727832ccd9d3535546.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7cd73c1a378e31727832ccd9d3535546.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/7cd73c1a378e31727832ccd9d3535546.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Praying is initiated when holding the F key. hold long enough to heal the MP yourself. Praying is also used for lighting candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden events could randomly happen while exploring the dungeon. It's up to you to check it out.</p>","developers":["dothouse0"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/c9e26d37b5cbe65fa16768acc3f8049045e6d629/header.jpg?t=1754414826","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3737700/1721766018/e9aaa5315f0edb66ac327d38b0bc9fbdd6e09724/1754412949/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754414824","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3737700/1721766018/e9aaa5315f0edb66ac327d38b0bc9fbdd6e09724/1754412949/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754414824","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3737700/1721766018/e9aaa5315f0edb66ac327d38b0bc9fbdd6